    "uuid": "061e2e56-b14c-4d95-9e18-d79c207bcc0d",
    "title": "Sakura Near My Houses",
    "slug": "sakura-near-my-houses",
    "html": "<p>I moved to 3 different houses in Japan during my time there, and each neighborhood had its own completely unique sakura scenery. This is a look back at those memories.</p><hr><h1 id=\"i-yoga-%E7%94%A8%E8%B3%80-march-25-2023\">I. Yoga (用賀) | March 25, 2023</h1><p><em>These images are from Kinuta Park (砧公園) vibrant. Its a huge park with a lots of sakura trees. I lived in a LeoPalace very close to the park. This was my first time seeing Sakura and at such a huge scale. </em></p><p>Fun Story : We lost our key to our house while playing football on some evening in this same park. Obviously we were panicking because the LeoPalace person told us that it'd cost us ~20K yen, which was huge amount of money for us, especially because we didn't get our first salary yet. We asked the police station nearby if they found the key, slept at friends apartment next to us, then went to find the key next morning. Fortunately we found the park's 'service center', where they asked the description of the key returned it to us. <br>Thanks to some guy who took the key to the service center</p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;\">\n      <div style=\"width: 100%;\">\n        <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_0665.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 16/9;\" alt=\"Sakura Tree 1\">\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem;\">\n        <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_0632.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Sakura Tree 2\">\n        <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_0727.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Sakura Tree 3\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->\n<h2 id=\"friends-me\">Friends &amp; Me</h2><p><em>I went with 2 other friends that day. It was raining a bit, but boy it was totally worth it. Check out the Sakura tree whose branches are almost touching the ground. </em></p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_0623.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Me in the Sakura\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_0635.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Friends in the Sakura\">\n    </div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->\n<hr><h1 id=\"ii-naruse-%E6%88%90%E7%80%AC-april-12-2024\">II. Naruse (成瀬)| April 12, 2024</h1><p><em>Naruse is famous for the numerous sakura trees planted on both banks of the Onda river (恩田川).</em></p><p><em>As you might have noticed, most of the flowers have already started falling and new leaves are on their way. Still the scene is beautiful</em></p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div style=\"margin: 2rem 0;\">\n      <!-- Block 1: Asymmetrical Grid -->\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60% calc(40% - 0.75rem); gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n        <div style=\"grid-row: span 2;\">\n          <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_5737.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem;\" alt=\"Naruse large left\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_5728.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Naruse right top\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/20240412_080632.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Naruse right bottom\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Block 2: Full width horizontal -->\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n        <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/20240412_080859.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover;\" alt=\"Naruse full width horizontal\">\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Block 3: Side-by-side -->\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/20240412_075352.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Naruse small side 1\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_5738.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\" alt=\"Naruse small side 2\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Block 4: Massive Full-width -->\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n        <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/20240412_081519.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: contain;\" alt=\"Naruse massive full width preserved ratio\">\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Block 5: Side-by-side -->\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/20240412_080507.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 3/4;\" alt=\"Naruse small side 3\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/20240412_081504.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 3/4;\" alt=\"Naruse new image side\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->\n<hr><h1 id=\"iii-nakayama-spring-2025\">III. Nakayama | Spring 2025</h1><p><em>The crisp spring air and sudden burst of pink flowers in Nakayama.</em></p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;\">\n      <!-- Block 1: 133523 Full Width -->\n      <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">\n        \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/20260405_133523.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; \" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2026 • 5:05 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Block 2: 1632 & 1703 Side-by-side -->\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; aspect-ratio: 2/1;\">\n        \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_1632.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; \" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2026 • 5:07 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_1703.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; \" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 6, 2026 • 1:09 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Block 3: 9029 Full Width -->\n      <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">\n        \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_9029.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; \" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2025 • 6:22 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Block 4: Crop for Size Grid (9051 is bigger) -->\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; width: 100%; align-items: stretch;\">\n        <!-- Left Col: Image.jpeg (Determines Height) -->\n        <div style=\"flex: 0 0 calc(40% - 0.375rem);\">\n          \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/Image.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; height: 100%; aspect-ratio: unset; object-fit: contain;\" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2025\n      </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Right Col: Stacked, taking up 100% of left column's height -->\n        <div style=\"flex: 0 0 calc(60% - 0.375rem); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;\">\n          <!-- 9051 (Bigger - Flex 1.5) -->\n          <div style=\"flex: 1.5; position: relative;\">\n            <div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0;\">\n              \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_9051.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; height: 100%; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: unset; object-fit: cover; position: absolute; inset: 0;\" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2025 • 6:50 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- 9042 (Smaller - Flex 1) -->\n          <div style=\"flex: 1; position: relative;\">\n            <div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0;\">\n              \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_9042.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; height: 100%; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: unset; object-fit: cover; position: absolute; inset: 0;\" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2025 • 6:31 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <h3 style=\"margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Friends &amp; Me</h3>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; aspect-ratio: 2/1;\">\n        \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_9016.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; \" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2025 • 6:17 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n        \n    <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"http://localhost:2368/content/images/2026/07/IMG_9031.JPG\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.75rem; \" alt=\"Nakayama Photo\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; font-family: sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.025em; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n        April 5, 2025 • 6:27 PM\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->\n",
